  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accin y Asistencia Humanitarian</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will help improve food security and health conditions for political prisoners in Cuba through the provision and distribution of humanitarian assistance in the form of food and health supplies. The program is designed to alleviate the hardships suffered by those who have lost some or all ability to support themselves or their families because of their political or religious beliefs.</narrative>
  </description>
